          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wa kabila la Naftali, Asheri, na Manase, wote waliitwa, wakawafuatia Wamidiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideoni akatuma wajumbe kote katika nchi ya milima ya Efraimu watangaze: “Teremkeni kuwakabili Wamidiani na kuwazuia kwa kuteka vijito na mto Yordani mpaka Beth-bara.” Basi, wanaume wote wa Efraimu wakaja na kuuteka mto Yordani mpaka Beth-bara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakachukua mateka viongozi wawili wa Midiani, yaani Orebu na Zeebu. Wakamuua Orebu katika mwamba wa Orebu, naye Zeebu wakamuua katika shinikizo la Zeebu, wakiwa wanawafuatia Wamidiani. Wakamletea Gideoni vichwa vya Orebu na Zeebu, ngambo ya mto Yordani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
